{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XnGQE39BNbcuGf8HEQAFKe","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The final agreed-upon name of the boolean config gating the new processing-exception-handler behavior for GlobalKTable processing errors as of 2026-02-20 is `processing.exception.handler.global.enabled`.\\\\n\\\\nSupporting facts in time order:\\\\n- Before 2026-02-20, the config was named `default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global`; this is the name Lucas Brutschy refers to when proposing the rename [mail:59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba].\\\\n- On 2026-02-20T09:41:00.000000Z, Lucas Brutschy proposed renaming it to `processing.exception.handler.global.enabled` (point lb3) in a review of the KIP [mail:59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba].\\\\n- On 2026-02-20T10:21:56.000000Z, Arpit Goyal confirmed he had updated the KIP to address all the points, including the rename [mail:d0ea5a94789da80c21eb21d1].\\\\n- No later message in the thread proposed a different name, so the rename stands as the final agreement as of the reference date [mail:59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba][mail:d0ea5a94789da80c21eb21d1].\\\\n\\\\nWhat could not be determined: The GitHub PR #21535 (opened 2026-02-21T17:14:48Z, after the reference date) does not name the config, and no earlier GitHub records mention it; the agreement is documented only in the mail thread. The exact KIP text itself is not in the available records, but the mail exchange confirms the adoption of the name.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"mail:59c5fd3092adaf090832eeba\\\",\\\"mail:d0ea5a94789da80c21eb21d1\\\",\\\"github:api:apache/kafka:pr-21535-opened\\\",\\\"mail:29c82027835a2e9497c104ed\\\",\\\"mail:14b5a72b00ab418669b42f66\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":59.213,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":14,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.00614531,\\\"input_tokens\\\":155848,\\\"output_tokens\\\":19446}}\"}"}]},"paren